      "content": "It is natural to feel despair when you see the cost of your recovery on those you care about, and the fear that cutting yourself out would finally end this pain is a very understandable reaction given your current suffering. However, self-sacrifice for the self-acceptance you crave often ends with you feeling more resentful and alone, while the support you desperately need to heal is cut off.\n\nPlease try to see that your \"selfish\" hope to escape pain is actually a desperate attempt to stop hurting yourself, but remember that healing is a journey you must walk alone even when it hurts to take steps.",
